.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]A brilliant but socially awkward inventor, Braun
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]lived alone surrounded by half-finished gadgets,
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]always chasing the one breakthrough that would
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]make his mark. That breakthrough turned out to
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]be Miho, a damaged android he found discarded
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]and repaired — who has stayed loyally by his side
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]ever since, upending his quiet, solitary life.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Introverted and easily flustered, especially
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]around women, Braun is nonetheless kind
.L 387.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]and honest to a fault — a terrible liar who
.L 397.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]wears his feelings openly. He can be
.L 407.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]absent-minded, and is an easy target for
.L 417.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]bullies.
.CP
.SH
\&Braun: Attacks
.PP
\&First Day of Sale Shove!: When a new Draconic Quest game is out, Braun can hold his place in line. Sometimes.
.SH
\&Braun: Inventions
.PP
\&Braun constantly scraps and rebuilds his inventions, but a few see regular use: a laptop with built-in hacking aids, and a pair of ordinary-looking glasses with several extrasensory functions, both kept handy via his Dimensional Pocket.
.SH
\&Braun: Connections & Cosplay
.PP
\&Braun occasionally trades in black-market parts he can't get otherwise, and sews and sells cosplay costumes for extra cash — including most of Miho's own wardrobe.
.SH
\&Braun: Fluff
.PP
\&Concept: Hopelessly Honest Inventor, Birthday: November 29, Age: 20, Gender: Male, Height: 5'8", Weight: 133 lbs., Hair: Brown, Eyes: Blue, Association: Mecha Monthly Charter Subscriber, Hobbies: Video Games, Favorite Food: Pizza, Allies: Miho, Enemies: Malicron Corp.
